   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Azure Firewall policy: only these rules, everything else is denied\nNETWORK  UDP/TCP 53  vnet-ai (10.2.0.0/16) → 10.1.0.4 (DNS Resolver)\nNETWORK  TCP 443  agent subnet → AzureActiveDirectory service tag\nNETWORK  TCP 1688  VM subnet → Windows KMS (activation)\nAPPLICATION  HTTPS 443  agent subnet → control-<region>.identity.azure.net,\n    *.identity.azure.net, <region>.login.microsoft.com, *.login.microsoft.com,\n    login.microsoftonline.com, *.login.microsoftonline.com",
   "originalText": "Azure Firewall policy: only these rules, everything else is denied\nNETWORK  UDP/TCP 53  vnet-ai (10.2.0.0/16) → 10.1.0.4 (DNS Resolver)\nNETWORK  TCP 443  agent subnet → AzureActiveDirectory service tag\nNETWORK  TCP 1688  VM subnet → Windows KMS (activation)\nAPPLICATION  HTTPS 443  agent subnet → control-<region>.identity.azure.net,\n    *.identity.azure.net, <region>.login.microsoft.com, *.login.microsoft.com,\n    login.microsoftonline.com, *.login.microsoftonline.com",
